{"id":"639764","name":"猪肉茄子馅蒸饺","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/639764/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"茄子","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肉、茄子。","img":"images/639764/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"猪肉剁成末。","img":"images/639764/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"茄子切丝，放入盐，抓拌均匀。","img":"images/639764/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"十几分钟后茄子软了，挤出不少水分。","img":"images/639764/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"茄子用清水洗两遍，把水攥干。","img":"images/639764/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"肉末放入碗内，加入姜、葱、酱油、蚝油、老抽、鸡精调味。","img":"images/639764/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"充分搅拌入味。","img":"images/639764/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把猪肉、茄子、小葱装入一个盆内，倒入油，再滴上香油。","img":"images/639764/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌均匀，馅就做好了。","img":"images/639764/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"买的饺子皮。","img":"images/639764/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"饺子皮内放入馅料。","img":"images/639764/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"捏成自己擅长的饺子花纹。","img":"images/639764/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"篦子上刷油，放入饺子，大火蒸15分钟。","img":"images/639764/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"时间到，饺子出锅。","img":"images/639764/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"蘸上喜欢的酱汁，很安逸哦！","img":"images/639764/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。第一次做茄子馅的蒸饺，味道很赞！","img":"images/639764/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}